{title: 404 - Now Let Us From This Table Rise}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #404 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 404}
{meta: category Doctrines - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Now let [G/B]us [Am]from [Em]this [F]table [G7]rise
[C]Renewed [Am/C]in [Dm]body, [Am]mind, [G/B]and [Dm]soul;
[G]With [F]Christ [G7/D]we [Am]die [C/E]and [Dm]live [Em]again,
[C]His [F]selfless [Am]love [G/B]has [G7/B]made [C]us [F]whole.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]With minds [G/B]alert, [Em]upheld [C/G]by [G7]grace,
[C]To [Am]spread the [Dm]word in [Am]speech [G/B]and [Dm]deed,
[G]We [F]follow [Am]in [C/E]the [Dm]steps [Em]of [Dm/F]Christ,
[C]At [F]one [G7/D]with [Am]all [G7/B]in [C]hope [F]and [C/G]need.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]To fill [G/B]each [Am]human [F]house [C/G]with [G7]love,
[C]It [Am]is the [Dm]sacrament [G/B]of [Dm]care;
[G]The [F]work [G7/D]that [Am]Christ [C/E]began [Em]to [Dm/F]do
[C]We [F]humbly [Am]pledge [G/B]ourselves [F]to [C/G]share.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]Then grant [G/B]us [Am]courage, [F]Father [G7]God,
[C]To [Am]choose again [Dm]the [Am]pilgrim [Dm]way
[G]And [F]help [G7/D]us [Am]to [C/E]accept [Em]with [Dm/F]joy
[C]The [F]challenge [Am]of [G7/B]tomorrow's [C/G]day.
{end_of_verse}
